{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12403","headline":"和范郎中宿直中书晓翫清池赠南省同僚两垣遗补 · 钱起","name":"和范郎中宿直中书晓翫清池赠南省同僚两垣遗补","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青琐留才子，春池静禁林。\n自矜仙岛胜，宛在掖垣深。\n引派彤庭里，含虚玉砌阴。\n涨来知圣泽，清处见天心。\n兰气飘红岸，文星动碧浔。\n凤栖长近日，虬卧欲爲霖。\n席宠虽高位，流谦乃素襟。\n焚香春漏尽，假寐晓莺吟。\n丹地宜清泚，朝阳复照临。\n司言兼逸趣，鼓兴接知音。\n六义惊摛藻，三台响掷金。\n爲怜风水外，落羽此漂沈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12403.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12403","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}